{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>TimeTrails 是一款以私隱為先的 GPS 軌跡記錄工具，會自動記錄通勤、遠足、跑步、步行與駕車行程，並在地圖上繪出每段路線與足跡，方便重溫走過的地方。無論日常通勤、運動訓練或外地旅行，都能以低耗電方式準確捕捉旅程，所有軌跡只存放於裝置本機。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多模式軌跡自動記錄</h2>\n<p>內置智能收集功能，自動平衡定位準確度與耗電，涵蓋步行、跑步、單車、駕車、遠足與飛行模式。每日摘要自動整理里程、時長與路線，並以點、軌跡線與聚合模式呈現數據。支援 WGS-84 與 GCJ-02 雙坐標系統，記錄只儲存於裝置本機；Apple Watch 可直接開始或停止記錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-33-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-34-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-35-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-36-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-37-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-38-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：TimeTrails: GPS Route Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T17:18:35.917995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":353,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}